---
layout: layouts/base.njk
desc: "Sarthak Bichhawa — applied AI and data platforms at Microsoft Azure Storage. Ask about his experience, explore the systems, and see the impact."
---

<div class="home-opening">
  <header class="home-hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="hero-identity">
        <img src="/assets/sarthak.jpg" alt="" width="44" height="44" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
        <p><strong>{{ facts.identity.name }}</strong><span>{{ facts.identity.title }} · Microsoft</span></p>
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero-title"><span class="sr-only">Sarthak Bichhawa. </span>AI that works.<br /><span>Where it matters.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">At Microsoft Azure Storage, I build AI that investigates incidents, explains customer health, and makes revenue data trustworthy.</p>
      <div class="hero-links"><a href="{{ facts.resume.file }}" data-goatcounter-click="hero-resume-pdf">View résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="mailto:{{ facts.identity.email }}" data-goatcounter-click="hero-email">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="home-assistant wrap" id="assistant" aria-labelledby="assistant-heading" data-portfolio-assistant data-site-url="{{ facts.meta.site_url }}" data-availability="checking">
    <div class="assistant-stage">
      <div class="assistant-stage-head">
        <h2 id="assistant-heading"><svg class="assistant-symbol" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 18 3 21V6a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h12a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v9a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H7Z"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h5"/></svg> AI portfolio assistant</h2>
        <button class="assistant-clear" type="button" id="assistant-clear" disabled>Clear</button>
      </div>
      <div class="assistant-conversation" id="assistant-conversation" role="region" aria-label="Conversation with the AI portfolio assistant" tabindex="0" hidden></div>
      <div id="assistant-live" class="assistant-live">
        <form class="assistant-form" id="assistant-form">
          <div class="assistant-composer">
            <div class="assistant-modes" role="group" aria-label="Assistant mode">
              <button type="button" data-assistant-mode="question" aria-pressed="true">Ask a question</button>
              <button type="button" data-assistant-mode="match" aria-pressed="false">Compare a role</button>
            </div>
            <div id="assistant-question-field" class="assistant-field">
              <label class="sr-only" for="assistant-question">Your question about Sarthak</label>
              <textarea id="assistant-question" name="question" rows="2" maxlength="1200" required placeholder="What would you like to know about Sarthak?" aria-describedby="assistant-status assistant-input-note assistant-privacy assistant-counter"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div id="assistant-match-field" class="assistant-field" hidden>
              <label class="sr-only" for="assistant-job">Public job description</label>
              <textarea id="assistant-job" name="jobDescription" rows="4" maxlength="6000" disabled placeholder="Paste a public job description. See relevant experience and honest gaps." aria-describedby="assistant-status assistant-input-note assistant-privacy assistant-counter"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="assistant-composer-bottom">
              <p class="assistant-input-note" id="assistant-input-note">Public questions only. Sent to OpenAI when you send.</p>
              <span class="assistant-counter" id="assistant-counter">0 / 1,200</span>
              <button class="assistant-cancel" id="assistant-cancel" type="button" hidden>Stop</button>
              <button class="assistant-send" id="assistant-send" type="submit" disabled aria-describedby="assistant-status"><span class="sr-only" id="assistant-send-label">Ask the assistant</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19V5m-6 6 6-6 6 6"/></svg></button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p id="assistant-status" class="assistant-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Checking live AI availability…</p>
          <p class="sr-only" id="assistant-privacy">Use public information only. Your text and up to two previous questions are sent to OpenAI when you send. Do not include personal or confidential information.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
      <div id="assistant-welcome" class="assistant-welcome">
        <div class="assistant-suggestions" id="assistant-suggestions" role="group" aria-label="Explore curated public answers">
          <span>Explore a guided answer</span>
          <button type="button" data-guide="why" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="guide-why">Why Sarthak? <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
          <button type="button" data-guide="ai" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="guide-ai">AI work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
          <button type="button" data-guide="leadership" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="guide-leadership">Leadership <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="guide-answer" id="guide-answer" hidden>
          <div class="guide-answer-head"><span>Curated public answer</span><button type="button" id="guide-close" aria-label="Close curated answer">×</button></div>
          <article id="guide-why" data-guide-panel="why" aria-labelledby="guide-why-title" hidden>
            <h3 id="guide-why-title">He connects AI to business impact.</h3>
            <p>Sarthak combines production AI with ownership of the systems it serves. At Azure Storage, that means agents that cut investigation time from hours to minutes, and a revenue-attribution recovery of ~$45M/mo on a $5B+/yr platform.</p>
            <div class="guide-sources"><a href="/case/incident-agent/">The AI work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/case/revenue-attribution/#recovery">The business impact <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
          </article>
          <article id="guide-ai" data-guide-panel="ai" aria-labelledby="guide-ai-title" hidden>
            <h3 id="guide-ai-title">Production agents. Reusable foundations.</h3>
            <p>An incident investigator that tests hypotheses against live telemetry. A customer-health agent spanning 13 metric domains. Four reusable MCP servers that make governed query and telemetry tools available to Copilot, VS Code, and internal agents.</p>
            <div class="guide-sources"><a href="/case/incident-agent/#architecture">Incident AI & MCP <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/case/customer-health-agent/">Customer-health AI <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
          </article>
          <article id="guide-leadership" data-guide-panel="leadership" aria-labelledby="guide-leadership-title" hidden>
            <h3 id="guide-leadership-title">He brings systems and teams together.</h3>
            <p>At Microsoft, Sarthak led a 4-team cross-org response and aligned 8+ engineering and support teams around a customer-health program. At Walmart Labs, he led 4 data scientists and 2 interns to productionize an item-level placement workflow.</p>
            <div class="guide-sources"><a href="/resume/#record-microsoft">Microsoft experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/resume/#record-walmart">Walmart Labs experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <details class="assistant-about">
        <summary>Public sources. Honest answers. <span>How it works</span></summary>
        <div><p>The guided answers are curated website content. Live replies come from an AI portfolio assistant that makes the strongest case supported by Sarthak’s public work, with evidence links and honest gaps. It is not Sarthak speaking or a firsthand reference.</p><p>Use only public questions or public job descriptions. Sending transmits your text and up to two earlier questions to OpenAI. Nothing is sent when you type or explore a guided answer. Conversation history stays in this tab and clears on reload or “Clear.” Source revision: {{ facts.meta.resume_rev }}. Replies may contain errors; check the sources. <a href="/colophon/#assistant-privacy">Privacy and processing details</a>.</p></div>
      </details>
      <noscript><p class="assistant-no-script">Live AI needs JavaScript. Explore the <a href="/case/">case studies</a> or <a href="/resume/">résumé</a>.</p></noscript>
    </div>
  </section>
  <a class="explore-work" href="#work">Explore the work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
</div>

{% include "partials/home-work.njk" %}

<section class="home-experience wrap" id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
  <div class="experience-intro">
    <p class="section-label">The person behind the systems</p>
    <h2 id="experience-heading"><span>Curiosity built it.</span> <span>Ownership made it matter.</span></h2>
    <p>From production ML at Walmart Labs to applied AI at Microsoft, I’ve worked across the model, the platform, and the people who depend on both.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/resume/">My full experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <ol class="career-list" aria-label="Career history">
    {% for role in facts.record %}
    <li><a href="/resume/#{{ role.id }}"><span class="career-company">{{ role.company }}</span><span class="career-date">{{ role.dates }}</span><span class="career-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="home-writing wrap" id="writing" aria-labelledby="writing-heading">
  <div class="home-section-head"><h2 id="writing-heading">Notes from the work.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/writing/">All writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <ul class="home-notes">
    {% for w in facts.writing %}{% if w.url %}
    <li><a href="{{ w.url }}"><span class="note-date">{{ w.date | humanDate }}</span><h3>{{ w.title }}</h3><span class="note-read">Read the essay <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></li>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="home-contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="section-label">A good next step</p>
    <h2 id="contact-heading">Let’s talk possibilities.</h2>
    <p>Open to senior roles in applied AI and ML leadership.</p>
    <a class="contact-primary" href="mailto:{{ facts.identity.email }}" data-goatcounter-click="contact-email">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <div class="contact-links"><a href="{{ facts.resume.file }}">Download résumé</a><a href="{{ facts.identity.linkedin }}">LinkedIn</a><a href="{{ facts.identity.github }}">GitHub</a></div>
    <details class="contact-summary"><summary>Copy a short introduction</summary><div><pre id="ats-summary">{{ facts.summary.ats }}
Site: {{ facts.meta.site_url }} · Résumé: {{ facts.meta.site_url }}{{ facts.resume.file }} · LinkedIn: {{ facts.identity.linkedin }} · Email: {{ facts.identity.email }}</pre><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm copy-btn" type="button">Copy</button></div></details>
  </div>
</section>
